  "_note": "Belt molecules not covered by scripts/molecule_icons (which is H/C/N/O only). 'pubchem' is fetched as a 3D conformer and its formula checked; 'structure' is inline (Angstrom) for ionic / inorganic compounds PubChem has no 3D conformer for. build_molecules.py merges these with the icon structures into Assets/Resources/BeltMolecules.json.",
